--- answer ---
The bug: `removeOldest` was removing `evictList.Front()` (the most-recently-used end, where `Add` pushes and `Get`/`MoveToFront` move entries) instead of `Back()`. All other oldest-related methods (`RemoveOldest`, `GetOldest`, `Keys`, `Values`) correctly use `Back()`. Fixed at `simplelru/lru.go:170`; tests pass.